@startuml 03-modules
!theme plain
title Modular monolith — internal modules

package "Activity Ranking Service" {
  [graphql] as GQL
  [activity-ranking] as Rank
  [scoring] as Score
  [store] as Store
  [refresh] as Refresh
  [open-meteo] as OMClient
  [geocoding] as Geo
}

database "PostgreSQL" as PG
cloud "Open-Meteo" as OM

GQL --> Rank : resolve query
Rank --> Store : load location + forecast days
Rank --> Score : pure functions (no I/O)
Rank --> Geo : resolve name → candidates
Rank --> OMClient : cold-start forecast
Geo --> Store : geocode cache hit/miss
Geo --> OMClient : miss → geocode API
Refresh --> Store : list tracked locations\nidempotent upserts
Refresh --> OMClient : forecast fetch
OMClient --> OM : HTTP
Store --> PG : SQL via Prisma

note right of Score
  Deterministic, versioned rubric.
  Compute-on-read (no score table).
  Unit-testable without DB or HTTP.
end note

note right of GQL
  Transport only; maps domain errors.
  In-process function calls.
end note

@enduml
